      "raw": "<p>Each Hero, villain, and environment add their own wrinkles. &nbsp; &nbsp;In this one as bluedarky pointed out is with Unforgiving Wasteland and Isolated Hero. &nbsp; Shattered Timelines will have one of the bigger cards I see requiring a lot of testing is Fixed Point. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
