      "id": 149331,
      "name": "Natediggadoggity",
      "username": "Natediggadoggity",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/f04885/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-10-09T21:46:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I could see the Scholar getting fiddly to code since his elemental forms aren't limited, and working out what happens when he stacks them all on top of each other.</p><p>Another possible hero variant would be Kvothe Six-String, the Argent Adept Variant. After that the only Variants that that haven't been mentioned in this thread (or Vengeance related) are the Freedom Six (Shattered Timelines) and the Prime Wardens (Wrath of the Cosmos) Chrono Ranger doesn't count, because he's also in Shattered Timelines.</p><p>Guise, Omnitron X, Parse, and Skyscraper don't have variants yet, I wonder if any of them will get one before Mini-Pack 3 is released.</p>",
