      "created_at": "2015-10-09T23:32:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't think that the forms should be too fiddly. &nbsp;Yes, they stack, but so does everything else. &nbsp;Two Liquid forms shouldn't be any harder to program than two Phosphorescent Chambers, and two Energy forms are the same as two Backlash Fields. &nbsp;The only new thing that he does is we've never had anything that triggers off of healing before. &nbsp;But we have plenty of damage triggers, so unless they coded healing significantly differently than they coded damage then there shouldn't be any problems.</p>",
